opam-version: "2.0"
synopsis:
  "HATch: falsifying representation invariants with Hoare Automata Types"
description:
  "Type-and-effect inference with Hoare Automata Types (HATs) and symbolic finite automata, used to find incorrectness witnesses for ADT implementations."
maintainer: ["Yongwei Yuan"]
authors: ["Zhe Zhou" "Yongwei Yuan"]
homepage: "https://github.com/yongweiy/HATch"
bug-reports: "https://github.com/yongweiy/HATch/issues"
